7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Yh4OgbXQSpQ_ycK_FmNiGw","review_id":"7SaFX0AeO8M1cjB8wUwWrQ","date":"2013-03-02T04:39:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9283575415611267,"text_excerpt":"We tried this last night. Got there early as I had heard it gets pretty busy later on. Loved everything. Homemade strawberry soda very refreshing and natural. Had the beets and an item not on the menu snails and tails. Escargot and crawfish tails. Wonderful hot crusty bread. Then mussels with black beans in a spicy chile infused broth. Bowls a creammmy grits. Wait staff must love their jobs. Smiled all the time and really seemed pleased that we were very enthusiastic about our choices. Also very reasonable. I liked the buzz of the place. Can't wait to go back"},{"business_id":"Yh4OgbXQSpQ_ycK_FmNiGw","review_id":"Uy7-g8ldktez3Gmb5gEfLg","date":"2013-07-19T20:05:02","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9280267953872681,"text_excerpt":"A tiny, fun place, with quirky decor (yes, look up, these are red Solo cups on the ceiling... and don't get me started on the deconstructed Barbie dolls) and very decent food. I've eaten there on a Thursday (which is a day of Mexican-inspired cuisine - I had a wonderful Burrito) and on a different day (regular menu). The salad with pickled red beets is heavenly. Good drinks, too."},{"business_id":"Yh4OgbXQSpQ_ycK_FmNiGw","review_id":"HKlX7T26W6C2otSkWWMpMA","date":"2015-10-13T16:47:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9238491058349609,"text_excerpt":"This place is a total gem! I came here for brunch this weekend and really enjoyed my meal. The atmosphere is casual, cool, and quirky. The server didn't come out to greet/seat us right away so I took that time to really look around the space. I love that the ceiling is made of solo cups! My dining companion and I started off with some $5 mimosas. They were quite small, but I let it slide because of the on point champagne to OJ ratio. We ordered the shakshuka and the pork breakfast tacos. I loved every single bite of my shakshuka! It was absolutely spot on. Spicy, savory, and tangy. I know I'll have a difficult time ever ordering something else. I also really liked the breakfast tacos, the..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Yh4OgbXQSpQ_ycK_FmNiGw","photo_id":"oN2dssGtTXStoUNXrTgXsA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/oN2dssGtTXStoUNXrTgXsA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8926501274108887},{"business_id":"Yh4OgbXQSpQ_ycK_FmNiGw","photo_id":"VJVCSlhT5WF_3bNF1YrDrQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/VJVCSlhT5WF_3bNF1YrDrQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7908507585525513},{"business_id":"Yh4OgbXQSpQ_ycK_FmNiGw","photo_id":"PNaM9EvdAao-tglkejeCsA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/PNaM9EvdAao-tglkejeCsA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7876205444335938}]},"notebook_case":null}
